WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:05.170
Everyone's got a favorite "As Seen On TV"
product.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:09.429
With goodies like the Snuggie, Shake Weight,
and even Magic Mesh, there's no shortage of

00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:13.230
weird crap for Americans to buy to solve problems
we never knew we had.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:17.790
But for each home run, there's a horrible
strikeout that should've never been created,

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.010
let alone be advertised on the airwaves.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:24.370
We've seen some weird As Seen On TV products
before, but you're going to need a whole lot

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.270
of OxiClean to purify your memories of these
horrible inventions.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.270
Bowl Brite

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:33.120
Do you have trouble distinguishing whether
your toilet seat is up or down?

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:37.260
And do you wish your nighttime trips to the
toilet could be accompanied by a ghostly green

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.040
or red glowing light?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.800
Consider this your lucky day, because Bowl
Brite has a solution for both problems.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.810
Simply install the batteries and LEDs on your
toilet lid and start enjoying a Christmas-themed

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:51.260
evacuation of your bowels and bladder!

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:55.690
Red means the seat's up, green means it's
down, and if you actually spent money on this,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.250
it means you're a lunatic.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:58.300
Dump Meals

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:03.510
From the maker of Dump Cakes now comes Dump
Meals, because if there's one word in the

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:08.790
vast expanses of the English language that
denotes a delicious delicacy, it's the word

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:09.790
"dump."

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:13.780
Dump Meals sound so appetizing, it's a wonder
that more restaurants don't feature them.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:15.290
Well, maybe it's a copyright issue.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:20.080
They might have to come up with a closely
related knockoff like Splatter Platters or

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.450
Painted Bowls.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.530
The possibilities are endless, really.

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:24.700
Sauna Pants

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.990
Any professional trainer worth listening to
will tell you that the key to achieving fitness

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:31.500
goals is a humid crotch.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.799
Calories consumed versus calories burned?

00:01:33.799 --> 00:01:38.250
Forget all that, because with Sauna Pants,
you can strap what is essentially an electric

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:43.310
heating blanket to your groin and just watch
the pounds melt away—and possibly your chances

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.480
of ever having children.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:49.460
But do you even know how hard it is to make
it to the gym when you have kids?

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.020
Neck Magic Air Cushion

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:55.820
If someone told you they were gonna strap
a device around your neck and use a pump to

00:01:55.820 --> 00:02:00.320
slowly increase the pressure and pull your
head away from your shoulders, you'd probably

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.420
wonder why your stalker was being so detailed
and upfront about his plans.

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:09.190
But you can rest easy if he's strapping the
Neck Magic Air Cushion around your throat.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:13.100
Because if he stops just short of blocking
your airway, you'll experience soothing muscle

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.540
relaxation and even headache relief!

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:16.700
Trust us on this one.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.560
There aren't many commercials floating around
of the Neck Magic Air Cushion, but we found

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:26.150
one of what is essentially the same product
with an even better name: DR-HO's Neck Comforter.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:27.989
My Secret Hair Enhancer

00:02:27.989 --> 00:02:29.620
There's really no secret here.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.160
This is spray paint for your bald spots.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.710
Nothing more, nothing less.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.730
It's an aerosol can full of hair-colored paint,
that you can use to coat the bare spots of

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.390
your scalp in between clumps of your thinning
hair.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:44.319
Spray paint's for graffiti and patio furniture,
not human heads.

00:02:44.319 --> 00:02:48.410
Don't use the My Secret Hair Enhancer unless
you're prepared for everyone to know your

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:52.390
secret right away…That you spray paint your
bald head.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:57.750
Let this commercial for My Secret Hair Enhancer's
predecessor from the '90s, GLH: Great Looking

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.920
Hair, say it all:

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.260
"But the babes are back!"

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.260
Potty Putter

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.220
Like Bowl Brite, Potty Putter attempts to
tackle yet another one of the many issues

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:10.690
that failed inventors feel need to be addressed:
spending too much time on the toilet.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:14.750
We always thought number two was a fairly
simple transaction, but apparently some people

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.120
feel that straddling the porcelain throne
is just too much wasted time.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:22.190
Now, you can practice your golf putt while
you poop, which will hopefully improve your

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:23.190
skills.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:27.480
And if your toilet overflows and messes up
your bathroom putting green, no problem!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.020
Just consider it a water hazard.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:32.769
Or dump kitty litter on the mess, and you
can practice getting out of a sand trap!

00:03:32.769 --> 00:03:36.260
Better yet, if you need more practice, go
ahead and drag a toilet out onto the actual

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.260
golf course.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:39.530
The country club will have no problem with
that.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.530
UroClub

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:45.209
Okay, somebody needs to explain what the deal
is with golfers and going to the bathroom.

00:03:45.209 --> 00:03:50.269
The UroClub is, sadly, exactly what it sounds
like: a hollow golf club that you pee into

00:03:50.269 --> 00:03:53.280
while a green towel discreetly covers your
private parts.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:57.080
It's a classy way to relieve yourself on the
course that allows for minimal interruption

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.080
of gameplay.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.150
Besides, how are you supposed to make awkward
eye contact with your buddies if you're way

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.129
off behind a tree or a bush?

00:04:03.129 --> 00:04:05.120
That just wouldn't do at all.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.959
Just a fair warning: this is an easy way to
make your golf caddy get P.O.'ed.

00:04:08.959 --> 00:04:10.099
Poo Trap

00:04:10.099 --> 00:04:14.680
Everyone knows how challenging it is to bend
down and pick up a doggie doo-doo.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:18.919
In an attempt to alleviate this brutal task,
here's a complicated harness system that you

00:04:18.919 --> 00:04:23.250
can attach to an excited, wiggling dog as
he practically drags his owner out the door—all

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:27.009
to hang a bag from the dog's butt, which the
owner still has to bend down and pick up.

00:04:27.009 --> 00:04:31.930
So either wait to buy this product until Poo
Trap version 2.0 possibly improves the design

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:36.469
with a pulley system or, you know, just bend
down and pick up your dog's crap.

00:04:36.469 --> 00:04:37.469
EZ Butter

00:04:37.469 --> 00:04:42.699
It always stinks to try to cut into butter
and encounter all of the problems that arise.

00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:48.030
Bent knives, broken fingers, uneven chunks,
and divorce are just a few, so thankfully

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.460
there's a contraption that takes care of all
of that.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:54.669
EZ Butter slices your butter into perfect
portions every time, and even shoots them

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:57.889
out with a fun click—it even works on margarine!

00:04:57.889 --> 00:05:02.909
It's like a staple gun for the kitchen, only
dumber and completely useless in every possible

00:05:02.909 --> 00:05:03.909
way.

00:05:03.909 --> 00:05:06.789
Brush Buddies One Direction Singing Toothbrush

00:05:06.789 --> 00:05:11.629
Because dental hygiene should always come
with an earworm capable of inspiring suicide,

00:05:11.629 --> 00:05:15.819
there's now a toothbrush that can play One
Direction music with the push of a button.

00:05:15.819 --> 00:05:20.139
On top of being highly entertaining while
removing plaque, this product offers the added

00:05:20.139 --> 00:05:23.889
bonus of infuriating everyone else whenever
you brush your teeth.

00:05:23.889 --> 00:05:27.800
Just think of the minutes of fun you'll have
fighting gingivitis while your wife scowls

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.509
and silently considers smothering you with
a pillow tonight.

00:05:30.509 --> 00:05:34.430
And the children won't be left out either
as they'll undoubtedly be googling how to

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.530
legally emancipate themselves from you.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.770
It's fun for the whole family!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.780
Thanks for watching!

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:43.460
Subscribe to our YouTube channel to watch
more videos like the one you just saw.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:47.449
And leave us a comment to let us know what
dumb products we should put on our next list...

